	<content contentuid="hf24badbagfb62g4b87g9218g804dd5bc9e8e" version="1">Your &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_SneakAttack"&gt;Sneak Attacks&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;additionally&lt;/b&gt; deal &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(damage type follows your equipped weapon)&lt;/i&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="hb99a835bgc582g4f8ag8603g19a462f93421" version="1">Thief's Hex</content>
	<content contentuid="hf7af68ceg3dbag46bbga676g838797557d3c" version="1">Your &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_SneakAttack"&gt;Sneak Attacks&lt;/LSTag&gt; may saddle the target with a &lt;b&gt;-[1]&lt;/b&gt; penalty to &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt; and &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="hc04c1cbcgacedg47cagbea7gb5105b783909" version="1">Rogue's Deftness</content>
	<content contentuid="h7ae5481fg7413g4cfag934ag7f80edb072db" version="1">You gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SleightOfHand"&gt;Sleight of Hand&lt;/LSTag&gt; and &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Stealth"&gt;Stealth&lt;/LSTag&gt; if you are a Rogue.</content>
